<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">OTAT - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Ɔtayitɔ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu ungwu Ɔpɔlu a ka laa OTAYITUSU</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɔtayitɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɔtayitɔ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa</para>
  <para style="mt1">OTAYITUSU</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔtayitɔ uwu bɔkɔ akwu umbwalu uwu bɔkɔ akwu Ozhu mo tete akwu umɛza mbala umbwama uwu Ɔpɔlu. A mbwalu Ɔpɔlu mu luzɛ wu undu anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Ɔtayitɔ gba akwu u to keyi uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Ɔkɔriti le. Kwupu kwɔlɛ kwu siso meka iyi apula ekpela.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyi kwonze o lolo Ɔtayitɔ meka iyi luzɛ undu bɔkɔ wa to keyi umba ɔshɔshi ifate lɔ zɛ undu lu yi kyamate luzɛ undura undu enzu umba Ɔkɔriti mo. Iyopo, Ɔpɔlu a ta Ɔtayitɔ amasa ewo iyi a zɔ enzu umba ɔshɔshi awu ɛzu uzhi uzhi: uzhi uwu anzɔnu enzumbakɔ, uzhi uwu ekokpayi enzumbakɔ (akwɛyi mba tete ɔ zɔ ekokpayi ɛmɛshɛri), uzhi uwu ɛmɛ anzɔnu alugbaga, mbala uzhi uwu enye. Mu imbwama yi u ka kwupu kwɔlɛ a ta Ɔtayitɔ amasa iyi luzɛ undu bɔkɔ lu fa laa umbwalu, luzɛ undu iŋɔma moloto, lo wo anya iyesu mo, lɔ zɛ gboo mbaa lɔmbu irimo, mbala apula iyi i bo la ikama mu ɔshɔshi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi wa to keyi umba ɔshɔshi (1.5-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi uzhi uzhi uwu enzu mu ɔshɔshi (2.1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Amasa itama mbala i yimo malu (3.1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso (3.12-15).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Imi, Ɔpɔlu, gba mi ka kwupu kwɔlɛ le. Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba a ŋa mi le te la mi kwu umɛgba wu mbala uzilɔ wu le. A ŋa mi te la mi mbwama la enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa, kaa ikwidufulo mbo mu Ɔzhizɔsi, mbala iyitu mbo mu iso iyi Ukpo li kyomo akwɛyi ɔ zɛ luzɛ undu Ukpo a gyi. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Ikwidufulo mbala iyitu ɛlɛ, i ri mu eyifulomo iyi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ moshi mbaa Ukpo. Ɛlɛ gba Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi le tee ee wo le dɛ ishi e be wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le. Ukpo ba a mulo mo. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Tabɔkɔ kwuye wu kwu wo mo, akwɛyi Ukpo a wa la iso ɛlɛ a ta yi kwudu ndunduu akwɛyi enzu o pwa yi. Ukpo gba e shi anu itama iyi ilɔ ɛnyi le, iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo, usama nzu a manda e shi mi te la mi wo.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Kwupu kwɔlɛ, mi ka ŋa, Ɔtayitɔ. Uŋɔ ŋɔ yi kyamate umɛ mi tayi kwuwongu kinzu wepepo nzu ki kwu wambwalu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Imi mi lɛ Edego-ala mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi usama nzu, te le shi ŋɔ esheshi wu mbala egbo inɔma.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛduma Iyi Ɔtayitɔ Mu Ɛzhi Iyi Okiriti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Ɔtayitɔ, Imi mi lu ŋɔ afyima mu Okiriti te kaa mbwa ɛduma iyi ishimo mɔmɔ iwomo le. Ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ ishimo gba akwu enzu itomo ka lɔ kwu enzu umbakɔ umba ɔshɔshi mu kwuse ungwunanguna le. Uŋɔ ka lolo iyi bɔkɔ mi za ŋa te wo, te, <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />onzu uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔɔ ŋa wu kaa lakwu onzu uwakɔ mu ɔshɔshi, lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e wo rara mo, lakwu ɔnu uwu oko ukpɛnyi ba a yama mo, ɛmɛ wu akwu wa mbwalu, lakwu ɛmɛ umba ishi mo, o lomo la umbete mbo mbala umbanyimba. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Utokeyi uwu ɔshɔshi gba akwu u bɔ eyi mu ɛduma iyi Ukpo le. Kwuwo kwɔngu, lakwu u wo rara mo, lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyi te iyawu gba li fye le iyɔkpɔɔ mo, ba lakwu u wo amba efyefya mo le to ɛnwu le shi atɛ, ba lakwu u wo ovyo mo, la kwu u ri ɔzawu mo. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Utokeyi uwu ɔshɔshi i fa te lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a na agboga ewo epo, a gyi iyeshi iwomo iyɔkpɔɔ, e yi ɛnwu kwuwo iyɔkpɔɔ, e yi ɛnwu wu ma iyɔkpɔɔ, luzɛ wu akwu lu sɛsɛ, akwu u mbwalu ototo. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />La kwu onzu uwu a ra la ɛzɔ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ awu gbagiri kaa uwu tete la ka enzu ɛnwu ma kaa lo mbwalu ɛzɔ etoto kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo yi mo awu, lɔ zɔngɔma te umba o ngbomo.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Umba bɔkɔ o gyi te lo lo watekeyi ma mo oyi gyɔɔ. Umba akwu wa zɔ ɛra-a akwɛyi o kyoro enzu mo te lo mbwalu yi. Enzu mbamba tayi gyɔɔ o wɔ mu uzhi uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɔ te u mbwalu uwunawuna la zɛ ɛsɔ ma. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Ki shi enzu mbamba tayi kapa kaa lɔ zɔ wa mbwalu ɛzu mo, moo ɛzɔ mba ɛlɛ gba i yi mu ikwu idu lu fulo iyi enzu gyɔɔ itutumo le. Ɛzɔ iyi bɔkɔ enzu mbamba o zɔ awu, o zɔ te kaa lɔ fya eduwo iyi o za wu le bi. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Anukenzu mba ukpɛnyi lala e so dɛ-ɛ, tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba Okirita akwu wa mulo iyɔkpɔɔ. O yi ira kyamate izɔfyi umbira tayi, akwu asuwa ba o yi kwuri ungwu ubwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu mba uwufo e so awu ba, te gba i yi le. Kwuwo kwɔngu, wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu iso iyi angba ɛnyi, tu mbo mo iyɛkɛkɔ kaa lɔ mbwalu iso iyi ongbulolo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, akwɛyi o kɔ ma mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Ɛlɛ ii shi mbo o shi alu mba esepo iyi bɔkɔ Azhu ɔ ta awu fo, ba ɔ mbwalu ɛrama iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo ototo imbwaluma awu fo. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi egbo sɛsɛ, kiya ingyinangyina akwu kɛ sɛsɛ munyi mbo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ egbo mbo akwiyira, ba akwu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mo, kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o wo, aakwu kɛ sɛsɛ mo. Egbo mbo ibyima akwiyira iyɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Umba o so te o yitu iyi Ukpo, ɔbulɛ luzɛ mba ba lu ri kaambu yi. Ukpo e wo kashi unga enzu mbamba tayi. O lo Ukpo mo mo. Umba o do kiya ingyesheshi kikpikpɛnyi iwomo mo.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kiya Ingyi Bɔkɔ I Fate Lo Zɔ Mu Ɔshɔshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Ɔtayitɔ, uŋɔ ba zɔ kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki zɛ kiya mbala ɛzɔ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Zɔ enzu umbakɔ anzɔnu te lo yi ɛnwu mba ma kaa enzu lo lo mbo mo, lo ngbɛndu mu iso isomo mbo mbala iwomo mbo. Lo rima gbagiri mu Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma mbala ipwudɛnyi mbala idu kwɔku.<verse eid="TIT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Enzu umbakɔ ekokpayi tete, uŋɔ zɔ mba kaa lo wiyi iyi Ukpo mungyemungye, umba lo kwu wa tutu enzu ma mo ba lo rala ɛmba lo shi atɛ iwomo mo, umba ba lo zɔ ɛzu iyi bɔkɔ i zɛ kya mbala ɛzɔ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />Akwɛyi umba o do te o zɔ eko umba anu ɛmɛshɛri kaa lo gyi anu mba mbala ɛmɛ mba, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />kaa lo yɛmba kwuwo kaa lo ŋɔ sɛsɛ, kaa lo wo ɛduma iyi kwogba mba, kaa lo kwu eko umbeshi kaa lo lomo la anu mba, kaa enzu lo zhi iso iyi Ukpo ma mo.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Ɔtayitɔ, uŋɔ za la akolobiya kaa lo yi ɛnwu mba ma tete. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Luzɛ ŋɔ lakwu marimari mungyemungye kaa umba lo vɔngɔ iyeshi iwomo munyi ŋɔ. Bɔ shɛ mu kiya ŋa izɔma laa egbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Siso iyi kwuyi iyi bɔkɔ enzu o do te o towo yimo mo, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o nyama mbala ŋa mo awu o fya kiya ingyira ingyi bɔkɔ o so meka nzu fo, akwɛyi lovya lu wo mbo mo.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Za la enye te lo lomo laa akwu mba mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna, lo wo ngyi bɔkɔ ada umba kwogba mba o gyi, lo ri kaambu mbala adakwogba mba mo. <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />Za mba te lo wu akwu mba ɛlɔ mo, umba ba lɔ zɔ te o kwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o fulo idu mamba, umba lo wo kaa iso iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a sa nzu ma awu, li lu enzu eyi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna. <verse eid="TIT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Moo esheshi iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i bo la isama le i wɔ gedegede la uwewe-e. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Esheshi ɛnyi i zɔ nzu te, la ki lafya la ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwu Ukpo mo mbala ekweyi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, te la ki yi ɛnwu nzu ma, te la ki bɔ shɛ, te la ki zɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />mate bɔkɔ ki yi mu eyifulomo iyi kwɔfi ungwu esheshi kwɔngu, mɔnu mawu gba inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo mbala usama nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi i wɔ ndundu le. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ra la ɛnwu wu e shi te kaa la wa nzu ma mu ira lɛɛbi, kaa la ra nzu le wo enzu wa kɛrikɛri lɛnwu umba bɔkɔ o gyi iyeshi iwomo. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Ɛlɛ gba akwiyi ŋɔ zɔ wa mbwalu mɔmɔ lɛɛbi le, mu ekpasu iyi ŋɔ yi yi awu, ka mba ɛnwu ma kaa gba yi mbo mu alu mu idomo ŋɔ lɛɛbi. Ki nyama te onzu la zhi ŋɔ ma mo.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Luzɛ Undu Lu Sheshi Tee Wambwalu Lɔ Zɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Koko kaa lolo enzu te, lo mbwalu asu mbala enzu umbakɔ umba ogomineti, lo lo mbo mo, lo yi ɛnwu ma iyi ɛduma iyeshi iwomo. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Za mba te lo siso iyira iyi onzu mo, lo kwu enzu umba ovyo mo ba lo kwu enzu umba egbo mɛzhi midu iyi uwewe.<verse eid="TIT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Za mba te, mekyi kinzu tete ki kwu erendo, ki lo iso iyi Ukpo ma mo. Ki nyama enzu o kyoro nzu mo, ki wo enzu enye umba ekweyi iyi apula iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu nzu i gyi. Kinzu ki ra la enzu mu akɔ ki gba ki wo rise ingyi esu, enzu o gyi nzu mo kinzu tete ki gyi esu mo. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo usama nzu ba e bo a ma eyembembyi nzu a gba e pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />akwɛyi a sa nzu ma. Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongu ɛduma iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ ki wo le mo, akwu kwuwongu eyembembyi iyi enzu iyi bɔkɔ e yi yi le. Ukpo e shi nzu Kwundu uwu Ukpo kaa la gbɔ ingbomo nzu ma akwɛyi e shi nzu kwunyɔ ungwepo kaa la ki zɛ luzɛ undu lu she wu. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Ukpo e shi nzu Kwundu wu rɛshi kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi usama nzu. <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ kwuwongu esheshi wu, akwɛyi a ma nzu te ki kwu enzu umba ingbomo fo, kaa la ki kwu wa ri ogu uwu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ ungwu bɔkɔ ki yi mu eyi ifulomo awu. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ mi so yi ele akwu iso iyi ongbulolo. Imi mi gyi te kaa so yi enzu shɛɛ, kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o shi egbo mbo mu Ukpo awu lo bɔ kwuyi mu iyeshi iwomo. Ɛzɔ ɛlɛ, i sheshi ba i mbwama laa uwewe.<verse eid="TIT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Uŋɔ mima mbaa kaambu unga erendo irimo, ku wa ɛdɔ iyi asɔkwu mo, ku tumo naa ewa ikirimo kwuwongu ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo, ɛlɛ te i bo la imbwama la uwewe mo, akwiyi umbwa. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo la ikama, yi mbo mu alu izhepo te lo wo ɛlɛ mo, gba o pwa iyaŋa mo, de ba zɛ gboo mbala mba. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Mu iwomo mba ɛlɛ te ŋɔ yitu te enzu mbɔlɛ te o kpɛdɔma-a kwuwongu iyira iyi bɔkɔ o wo awu, akwu ɛkashi gba o yi mu iwomo le.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iso Iyi Imbwambwa Iyi Mi So Yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Kwuye ungwu mi lɔ Atima naa Otakiku mbaa ŋa, uŋɔ wo ekpasu kaa bo kaa du mi mu Onikopoli, kwuwongu mi ka amasa te mi yi mɔmɔ nzhii ba evya ela kwuyengwu okpakyi. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ozina Oloya awu mbala Apɔlɔsi o bo fulomo awu, wo ekpasu ŋɔ, kaa shi mbo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki mbwa mba ma akwɛyi ba o yi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ umba o gyi mu luzɛ mba. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Enzu nzu lo gyakpɔɔ mu iyeshi iwomo kwuyengwunanguna la enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi igɔ, kaa ɛmanyi nzu wa mbwalu mbɔlɛ lo ŋɔma iyi umbwa mo.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala mi munɛ o ye ŋɔ mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma. Uŋɔ ba gbɛlɛ wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o gyi nzu awu ɛnyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Esheshi iyi Ukpo li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>